  20:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/BSP/Components/mx66uw1g45g/mx66uw1g45g.c ****   *     DOPI = 1 and SOPI = 0: Operates in DTR Octal IO protocol (accepts 8-8-8 commands)
